{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A transaction sits beside the month its day falls in rather than in a file of its own."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Ten thousand transactions arrive from a poller and nobody writes a transaction by hand."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An entry states nothing that entry has no value for."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A value an entry does not state is false or empty."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Entries sit in the order of the day those entries fell on and then of their Monarch id."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A split transaction leaves the list Monarch serves and its parts are there in its place."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A split transaction stays alive and reachable by its own id."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An entry's id is carried across a resync rather than minted again."}]}
